Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:04.57,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,So this is the Spire of Magecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.58,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.38,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,The holy land of mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:11.67,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,The place I was raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:23.58,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,This is said to be the best place \Nin the world for training magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:27.80,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Though, honestly, only the select few with \Nexceptional talent are able to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:33.56,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,It might be a bit difficult for you three,\N since you just learned to use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:41.77,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,It's more convenient to gather groups \Nfor magic research and training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:45.64,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,You've seen how effective it is\N to have someone show you how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:50.64,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:59.83,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:03.25,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:06.21,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,They're... kind of quiet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:09.92,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,The people here all shoulder something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:14.27,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Be it famous houses, \Npersonal ambitions, or so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:18.57,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,They don't have time for interest in others.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.65,0:01:23.23,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Okay, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.19,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Yes, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:41.74,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Ring Princesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:44.45,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I'm in charge of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.45,0:01:46.46,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I've already heard about what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.77,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I'm glad you've come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:53.96,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you for having us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.91,0:02:04.18,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,You resemble her so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:06.27,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Um, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:08.52,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Oh my, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.11,0:02:12.48,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I'm the one who taught your mother magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.85,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,This is so nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.85,0:02:18.61,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Morion resembled her as well, \Nbut you even more so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:20.49,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,My mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:23.12,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,It's my first time hearing about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:28.04,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,You see, I'm your grandmother's little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:29.69,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,That makes me your great aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:32.59,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I met you when you were a baby, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:34.65,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Though you probably don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:38.67,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Many of the people \Nin the Nokanatika royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:41.37,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,possess great magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.37,0:02:44.26,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have talent \Nsleeping within you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:48.73,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,So you don't need to look so troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:55.46,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Your duty is probably \Nunfathomably heavy to bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.93,0:03:00.20,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,but let's work together \Nto develop your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:02.52,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:10.85,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Now, first, allow me to be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:15.59,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,It's hard to say you all are properly \Nhandling the Rings' magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:23.18,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,We're going to have you build up enough \Nstrength to stand alongside the Ring King.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:25.39,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,I'll handle fire magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.77,0:03:29.10,Default,Elf,0,0,0,,I'm the most skilled with wind magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:34.44,Default,Elf,0,0,0,,Our magic research \Nwill surely prove useful to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:37.02,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:40.08,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,So let's get your training started.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:14.40,Flashback,Hime,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:18.17,Flashback,Hime's Mother,0,0,0,,Don't make that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:20.17,Flashback,Hime's Mother,0,0,0,,I'll see you again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:25.84,Flashback,Hime's Mother,0,0,0,,You'll have to take care of these from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:33.72,Flashback,Hime,0,0,0,,Yes, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:39.90,Flashback,Hime's Mother,0,0,0,,Go on, and take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:44.47,Flashback,Hime's Mother,0,0,0,,Farewell, my darling child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:57.79,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Let's stop here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:00.25,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yes, Professor Perlee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:05.09,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,What do you think of training \Nin the Room of Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:08.38,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Frankly, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:12.88,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I can't fault you for getting worked up\Nover it, given its pretentious name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:13.85,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:16.82,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,That's just a pitch-black room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:21.67,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,It's a place for you to face yourself \Nand illuminate that darkness with your light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:26.19,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,It's said that your predecessor \Nawakened great power in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:31.65,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Light magic is the power to shine on \Nthe Abyss and destroy evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:37.04,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,It's fundamentally different from the other \Nfour magics, which deal with the tangible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:43.04,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,It's a power that only you and \Nthe Ring King can use in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:47.16,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,But Grandpa made things glow before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:49.29,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Alabaster's magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:52.64,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,He was probably using \Nan application of fire magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:56.22,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,A torch's flame lights up \Nthe surroundings, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:58.91,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,The sun also shines brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:02.52,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,But neither of those are \Nthe light that can repel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:05.00,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Light magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:09.45,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,is said to be the glow born from \Nthe strength of one's desire to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:13.16,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Desire to exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:16.43,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,That's what's been passed down,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:18.87,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,though I don't know exactly what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.51,0:07:22.49,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I can't use light magic either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:25.21,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,No one here can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:31.22,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,The one person who should have passed it\N down to you is no longer with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:34.55,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,so you'll just have to figure out \Nhow to grasp it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:44.53,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Let's take a little break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:45.44,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:50.19,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,By the way, what is this Satou-kun like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.20,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:54.08,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,He followed you here \Nall the way from another world,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:56.21,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,so he must be a passionate man, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:58.05,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,N-Nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:07:59.50,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,He's normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:01.21,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Though...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:05.46,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,When it involves me, he tries really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:07.38,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,He always has, ever since we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:13.68,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,He has a few odd quirks, \Nbut I can relax when I'm around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:16.51,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,What a lovely man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:20.82,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Let's do our best for Satou-kun too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:22.05,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.05,0:08:26.81,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I can still walk you through\N the fundamentals of using magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.81,0:08:30.42,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be able to grasp \Nhow to use light magic too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.89,0:08:32.00,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:40.39,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,Mother was able to use it \Nas the Light Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:43.29,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,I need to work hard to catch up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:45.29,Flashback,Perlee,0,0,0,,What a lovely man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:50.62,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,M-Morion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.12,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:56.72,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,You look a little down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:04.52,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I just thought I'd have someone \Nto teach me if I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:08.80,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I thought I'd just have to worry about \Nputting in the effort to master it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:13.61,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,So isn't it awful that no one \Ncan teach me light magic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:15.61,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,What did I even come here for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.61,0:09:17.53,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,You have a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:21.22,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Still, you should be able to find \Nsome kind of hint here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:23.08,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,That's the kind of place this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:24.80,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:28.29,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,You'll be fine, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:32.45,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,I was able to hang in here \Nby myself for ten whole years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:36.00,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,So I find it unlikely that\N you won't be able to use magic too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:44.60,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,There are no toys or sweet treats here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.57,0:09:47.90,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,No friends my own age either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:51.43,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,My life here was always boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:56.90,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,That was all because \Nyou inherited the Ring so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:09:59.34,Default,Hiime,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.06,Default,Hiime,0,0,0,,I'm sure you must resent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:03.34,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:03.99,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:08.83,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,I mean, it's common for the one who doesn't \Ninherit the crown to pursue the path of magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.27,0:10:11.67,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,so there's nothing to resent or hate you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:17.53,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,I just think I've longed for a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.13,0:10:20.72,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,I realized that after seeing \Nyou and Brother together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:25.56,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,If only I had someone like him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:28.75,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Then I'd be all flustered \Nand horny just like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:31.10,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,and I might not even have time to feel bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:33.53,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,H-Horny?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:34.32,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,0)\pos(500,10)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad2\fs28\c&HC715B3&\4c&HFCDDFB&}Horny
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.69,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I-I'm not giving you Satou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:37.70,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:39.64,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Wouldn't hurt to share, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:40.76,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:42.16,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:45.37,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Hey! Satou's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.53,0:10:49.10,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,You're too sensitive, Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:52.84,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,Also, are you telling me \Nyou're already starting to miss him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:53.46,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:55.94,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:58.06,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,maybe a little true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:02.46,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,It's true that you won't be able \Nto see him for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:05.24,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,but that should just \Nhelp your love burn brighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:08.27,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,You can just show him \Nhow much you've improved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:11.71,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:29.12,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:31.47,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:35.23,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,It's been a while, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:39.51,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,It's been nearly a week since we \Nstarted our training here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:41.29,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:46.65,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,This Spire of Magecraft is \Ntruly a wonderful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.65,0:11:49.48,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,No matter where I go, everyone's very quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:51.53,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,so I don't have to fret about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:52.92,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:56.11,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,I suppose this would be \Na nice place for you, Nefritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.07,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,So, is your teacher treating you well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.28,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:06.50,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Krystal-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:08.24,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,you seem a little troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:10.11,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.11,0:12:13.33,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Apparently, light magic is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:16.54,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I've heard that light magic is \Nsimilar to wind magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:20.44,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,in that it handles something you can't grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:24.92,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Though it is difficult when the number of \Npeople who can use it are limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.92,0:12:27.68,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I wish there was something \NI could do to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:30.03,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nefritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:31.86,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,But I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:34.27,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,For now, just focus on yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:36.69,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,and build up the power to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.65,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:43.05,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Granart?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.05,0:12:44.60,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,What happened to your face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.03,0:12:49.37,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Nebulous things like magic sure are difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:52.25,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,But I'm starting to get the general idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:54.98,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Rather than manipulating flames at will,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:59.67,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,I'm turning the fire magic burning \Nwithin me into physical strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:02.12,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,It's manageable once you get the hang of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:03.63,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,You should hang in there too, Krystal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.88,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah... Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:14.38,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,I do get hopelessly hungry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.38,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Your wounds are more important!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:18.15,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,How'd that happen in magic training?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:19.52,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:22.73,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Come on, Granart! Don't be so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:25.84,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,You should invite me too \Nif you're having a meal with friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:26.70,DefaultItalics,Both,0,0,0,,Who is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.28,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:31.85,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Her mother, Rubyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:33.29,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Her mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:34.50,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:36.79,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,What is Granart's mother doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.61,0:13:41.29,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,You mean, the fire magic teacher...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.57,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:46.12,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,The fire magic teacher was my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:47.38,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:49.43,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,"Yay"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:52.80,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Once I finished rearing Granart,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:55.79,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,I left Needakitta to go \Non a journey and train myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:59.32,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,And I found my way to this Spire of Magecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:02.61,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,It's all so I can beat down that \Nloathsome husband of mine one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:06.57,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,It seems like my daughter \Nthought I had abandoned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:08.98,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Because you didn't say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:12.08,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Didn't I? I was sure I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.14,0:14:17.58,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,I wanted to spend more time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:19.97,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Really, really? I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.97,0:14:22.88,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making you feel lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:25.15,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,I'm happy, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:28.41,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,You've grown up so well and made it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:30.94,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Right, little Grameowt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.89,0:14:33.31,DefaultItalics,Both,0,0,0,,Meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:37.72,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,When this girl was little, she had \Ntrouble saying her own name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:39.58,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,Come on, try saying your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:42.76,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Granart! Don't treat me like a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:46.19,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,You've grown so much, little Grameowt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:52.00,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,It seemed like Granart-sama was \Ntroubled over her mother before,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:49.26,DefaultTop,Granart,0,0,0,,Enough! Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:52.00,DefaultTop,Rubyn,0,0,0,,I'm just so, so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:54.66,Default,Nefritis,0,0,0,,so I'm glad that they got to meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.05,0:14:54.19,DefaultTop,Granart,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.19,0:14:56.00,DefaultTop,Granart,0,0,0,,I get it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:58.12,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:15:00.37,Default,Rubyn,0,0,0,,There, there, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.37,0:15:02.27,Default,Granart,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:17.46,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,Nefritis and Granart are both \Nmaking steady progress,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:19.90,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,but I'm still at a standstill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:22.91,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,I miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.51,0:15:25.84,Flashback,Satou,0,0,0,,Let's both do our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:28.78,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Satou.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:33.14,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,You might be okay without me nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:37.68,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,but it seems I'm hopeless without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:44.14,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:46.87,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:49.54,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,Who could it be at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:54.64,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,You're the Nokanatikan princess \Nthat arrived here recently, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:56.96,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:16:01.79,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,I know quite a bit about light magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.31,0:16:04.68,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,You seem to be having trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:07.23,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,so I thought I might be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.18,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:16.11,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:20.87,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,I don't recognize this woman, \Nbut she seems very familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:25.38,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,You want to learn how to \Nuse light magic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:26.56,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:30.17,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,It hasn't been going very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:32.30,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,You've done well on your own so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:34.04,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:37.10,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Everyone's been very kind \Nand encouraging to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:42.96,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,However... in the end, \Nit all rests on you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:54.11,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Light magic is the strong desire to \Nexist here, the magic of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:57.21,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,It's a feeling that everyone experiences,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:16:59.91,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,but is very difficult to be aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:03.66,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Professor Perlee said something similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:06.75,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.17,0:17:09.15,Default,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,You are not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:11.85,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,So warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:15.00,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,This is the flow of magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.47,0:17:17.47,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:22.54,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,I wonder who that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:34.57,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,I told you, you're being too cold with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:37.34,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I have little choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:40.12,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I can offer her help, \Nbut the rest is up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:44.25,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Light magic is something \Nshe has to obtain on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.25,0:17:48.21,Default,Morion,0,0,0,,The only one my sister can rely on here is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:50.67,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,But you realize, Morion,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:55.88,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,I can never be that child's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.49,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:09.31,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,It's like all your struggles were a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:15.02,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Why the sudden change?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:18.36,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Actually... someone taught me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:21.00,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:24.45,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be anyone in this spire \Ncapable of using light magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:25.35,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.87,0:18:29.51,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Well, regardless, this is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.09,0:18:31.37,Default,Perlee,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:33.86,Default,Hime,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:39.62,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,Satou...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:42.41,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,A-Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:47.90,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,So this is the empire's factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:48.95,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:53.90,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,All the arms used by our soldiers to fight \Nthe forces of the Abyss are manufactured here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:55.34,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:57.65,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,By the way, what's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:18:59.99,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,Why did you say you wanted \Nto look around the empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.99,0:19:02.45,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.85,0:19:06.27,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,The people of the empire are fighting \Nagainst the Abyss King, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:08.71,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,So I wanted to see \Nwhat kind of place the empire was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:10.11,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:12.74,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,But, given my current position,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:15.10,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,I can't show you around \Nthe inside of the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.10,0:19:18.05,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,No, no, seeing the outside is good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:24.46,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,Does Marse-san really believe \Nhe's disguised himself with that mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:26.64,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,Hey, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:28.02,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,What are you doing over there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:29.00,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:31.64,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I was just looking at it from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.38,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,Hmm? You're the Ring King!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:37.65,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,That's admirable of you, \Ncoming out to inspect the factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.44,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,In that case, don't be shy \Nand come have a look inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.44,0:19:41.53,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,That guy with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:42.46,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.95,0:19:46.32,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,W-Would you like to \Naccompany him as well, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:49.72,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,I think I'll take you up on your offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.59,DefaultItalics,Satou,0,0,0,,He definitely noticed who he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:00.96,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,This is incredibly huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:05.89,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,Gisaras has always been a nation \Nof warriors that defended Nokanatika,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:09.78,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,but we only recently\N built factories this large.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.09,0:20:14.36,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,This factory is truly \Nthe cornerstone of the strength
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:16.94,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,that let us unify the neighboring nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:20.46,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,You were looking around \Nthe city today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:22.03,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,What did you think of the empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:24.46,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I thought this is a nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:26.41,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Far better than I'd been imagining.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:31.50,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Though it seems like the Emperor \Nisn't that happy to have me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:36.33,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,So I thought the people of the empire \Nwould be the same way... but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:40.97,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,We don't have any idea \Nwhat the Ring King's power is like,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.97,0:20:45.43,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,but we have in faith you as \Na comrade-in-arms against the Abyss King!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:51.31,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,All the people working here \Nand all the soldiers feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:52.52,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:56.36,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm not that confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:21:00.94,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I'm capable of \Nliving up to that faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.54,0:21:06.46,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,People call you the Ring King, \Nbut you look like you're still a young kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:08.41,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,Can't blame you for feeling that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:11.15,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.15,0:21:13.94,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,You're not the only one fighting out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:16.62,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,Even if any of us lose our lives in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:20.28,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,we've all chosen to be out there fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:22.51,Default,FactoryFather,0,0,0,,You must never forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.09,0:21:28.37,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Thank you for showing me \Naround today, Marse-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.37,0:21:30.05,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.67,0:21:34.64,Default,Marse,0,0,0,,I'm happy that you've taken \Nan interest in my homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:38.10,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:41.57,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Oh, you're back, Satou-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:45.15,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Looks like you had a meaningful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:46.40,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:50.33,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,I realized I need to do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:57.79,Default,Alabaster,0,0,0,,Then, tomorrow, we'll finally carry out \Nour infiltration of the Mythic Armory!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.55,0:22:04.34,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.31,0:22:08.50,DefaultItalics,Hime,0,0,0,,Satou...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.39,0:22:16.85,DefaultTop,CreditSign,0,0,0,,TRANSLATOR: JOHN PICKETT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:20.86,DefaultTop,CreditSign,0,0,0,,TIMER: KRZYSZTOF KUNC\NEDITOR: ZACHARY CARLYSLE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.36,0:22:24.74,DefaultTop,CreditSign,0,0,0,,QC: WILLIAM HAGGARD\NFQC: SRIRAM GURUNATHAN

